5615 0 obj
<</Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/Alt (Decision tree for secrets and certificates and keys, with results labeled by pattern name. Secrets and certificates: use a Standard or Premium vault in each region for customer-managed application failover, or a Standard or Premium vault in a paired region when eligible and Microsoft-managed recovery timing and read-only access are acceptable. Keys: choose Managed HSM with external key management for external custody; Managed HSM with geo-replication, optionally with external HSM and BYOK, for a shared replicated key store; Standard or Premium vaults in each region, or Premium vaults per region with external HSM and BYOK, for independent regional vaults; or a Standard or Premium vault with paired-region replication for eligible Microsoft-managed recovery. Validate consuming-service support first.)
/P 5608 0 R
/K 5616 0 R>>
